    "summary": "South London drummer and bandleader: half of Yussef Kamaal (Black Focus, 2016), Tom Misch's partner on What Kinda Music (2020), and leader of Black Classical Music (2023). Dense, linear 16ths where hat, ghosted snare and kick take turns, a backbeat that slides off 2 and 4, kick clusters on one foot, buzzes and flams on a tight snare, all played without a click. Jazz, Afrobeat, reggae, sabar and jungle in one vocabulary."
  },
